		{
			dependencies: ["24F94D88BBD152DF"]
			description: [
				"&o&7Notes from Eleonore's Travels, Tome IX"
				""
				"&2The realm of Dis is well suited to the &m---------&r&2' quarries, being an external world where destroying the environment doesn't matter, but quantities of ore still generate."
				""
				"&2Dis is quite the spooky place, with dark water, unknown lighting and barren wastelands of marble. I made a standardized portal to enter, resembling the Netherworld's own.&r"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&2Dis is known for being a quarrying dimension, but why isn't it a mining dimension? Well, as an outsider living being, the ores of Dis will slowly infect you until your sudden demise. As quarries are machines, this does not apply to them.&r"
				""
				"&2Do not go mining in Dis. Nothing good will happen to you. Except perhaps large fortunes.&r"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&2There are vast black seas in Dis, and ores are most commonly found under sea level. One great benefit of Dis is that both Overworld and &lNether ores&r&2 are found there. The marble is still very useful, though. It can be compacted and then crushed into various powders.&r"
				""
				"&2The resulting apatite powder can then be crushed even further into other kinds of powders. There are faint traces of diamonds in the marble of Dis.&r"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&2Dis gems can be found uncommonly throughout Dis. They contain rare and powerful materials inside, encased in a resin substance. Splitting the dis gem with lightning can be enough to both free up the core, and perhaps charge it? These gems make for great fuel in a lapiary dynamo, similar to other gems found in Dis or can be used to make special equipment. "
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&2The Dis Wand is a multitool similar to a paxel, with the ability to swat away bad weather in Dis. "
				""
				"&2The Dis Crown can be worn to dampen the effects of inter-dimensional travel. No more do we need to carry buckets of milk everywhere!"
			]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
			hide_until_deps_complete: true
			id: "31D128CA9B959085"
			rewards: [{
				id: "4F42D70E5078D10B"
				type: "xp_levels"
				xp_levels: 1
			}]
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "14827DF920182D05"
					item: "perdition:marmor_elevated"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					id: "65C6CEC5A128D02B"
					item: {
						Count: 1
						id: "perdition:dis"
						tag: {
							Damage: 0
						}
					}
					type: "item"
				}
			]
			x: -8.0d
			y: 8.5d
		}
