					Count: 1
					id: "perdition:halcyon"
					tag: {
						Damage: 0
					}
				}
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: -5.0d
			y: 5.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["19CD7CA150532811"]
			description: [
				"&o&7Notes from Eleonore's Travels, Tome II"
				""
				"&fBlood provided essential spiritual power for ancient witchcraft, but can also provide physical nutrition, should you have enough to spare. Some ancient witches even had a diet entirely comprised of blood, and I did too, for a while. Your stomach learns to accept it, after a while..."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&o&7Notes from Eleonore's Travels, Tome IX"
				""
				"&2Some peculiar prized ores are found throughout Purgatory and particularly in the Purgatory chasms. "
				""
				"&2These are silver and pyrite ore, both equally useful when smelted into silver and witch's gold. While witch's gold may only be more useful to witches, silver is useful to all pathways, from technology to magic.&r"
			]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
			hide_until_deps_complete: true
			id: "585D9482FF0C3669"
			rewards: [{
				id: "77BC42B3AE71E6A3"
				type: "xp_levels"
				xp_levels: 1
			}]
			tasks: [{
				id: "408228206A22A454"
				item: "perdition:pyrite"
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: -2.5d
			y: 4.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5D06B3DA89CB0B2E"]
			description: [
				"&o&7Notes from Eleonore's Travels, Tome IX"
				""
				"&2Purgatory is a fascinating dimension, filled with mystical ingredients and various anomalies.&r"
				""
				"&2I have noted down the various ingredients found and their uses below. Traveling through the dark lands, you will need a lantern to see more than 2 feet in front of you.&r"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&2The two main ways of entering Purgatory remain the Halcyon sword, which can be crafted by either those who have entered Purgatory themselves, or those who scavenged enough anomalous or elemental parts to make an artificial Halcyon, such as the researchers of the &m--------------&r &2or the elementists of the &m-----------&r&2. The second is to drink a planeswalker potion, made by the witches of &m--------&r&2.&r"
			]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
			hide_until_deps_complete: true
			id: "19CD7CA150532811"
			rewards: [{
				id: "38CA7A27C0E80D2D"
				type: "xp_levels"
				xp_levels: 1
			}]
			tasks: [{
				dimension: "perdition:purgatory"
				id: "50B8E170985B1E51"
				type: "dimension"
			}]
			x: -4.0d
			y: 4.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["31D128CA9B959085"]
			description: [
				"&o&7Notes from Eleonore's Travels, Tome IX"
				""
				"&2How did the door to Dis open? While trying to open a rift, I seem to have pierced through some kind of barrier formed from gray fog. My rift blade broke, but I ended up in this place. With the quartz and diamonds I had, I turned some of this normal marble into an elevated one, which someone managed to turn into a portal. After years of researching how to return, I've finally done it.&r"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&2This is not too useful of a dimension, but perhaps I could recommend that my Hierophant friends go quarrying here instead of destroying the world constantly. I did find this travel journal lately. To the next one who finds it, I will stick a little note for you!&r"
			]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
			hide_until_deps_complete: true
			id: "2F27E02457BCBE92"
			rewards: [{
				id: "6D11E49B43144F14"
				type: "xp_levels"
				xp_levels: 1
			}]
			tasks: [{
				dimension: "perdition:dis"
				id: "543BA042D0B534A5"
				type: "dimension"
			}]
			x: -7.0d
			y: 7.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["19CD7CA150532811"]
			description: [
				"&o&7Notes from Eleonore's Travels, Tome II"
				""
				"&fThis strange sword resonates with the essence of experience within the body, ripping it out as small, marble-sized spheres. A small pain as the price of progress. It purges your inner experience into dark blue globby orbs. They can be consumed again to regain your levels."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&fThe experience orb is obtained through purging your own experience from your body with the Shrike sword &a(right-click with the sword, with experience levels)&r. &fWhile you can simply consume these orbs to gain back your levels, they are also used in various recipes."
			]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
			id: "4317E4672B9BDFF5"
			rewards: [{
